A number of prominent <span style="color: var(--leftcom); font-weight: bold;">Leftcoms</span> have resigned their posts, while a fierce agitation campaign is launched against the peace treaty. 

  - @goto_brest_cec_vote
  
@allow
title: Placate the dissenters in the name of keeping the Party together. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.leftcom_dissent -= 5; 
!}

By making assurances to the other CC members, Lenin is able to stave off resignations for now, though few fully satisfied. 

- @goto_brest_cec_vote

@goto_brest_cec_vote
title: And now we must get the CEC signed on...
go-to: brest_cec_vote
